---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Harrow &amp; Thread"
  description="How we use cookies on the Harrow &amp; Thread website."
>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="shell max-w-narrow">
      <h1 class="display text-3xl xs:text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-ink mb-5 reveal">
        Cookie Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-graphite mb-12">Last updated: 13 September 2026</p>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">What are cookies?</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-8">
        Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work, or work more efficiently, as well as to provide information to the site owners.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">How we use cookies</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-8">
        We use cookies that are strictly necessary for the site to function. These do not require your consent and are always enabled. With your consent, we may also use analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our site; these help us improve the experience but are entirely optional.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Strictly necessary cookies</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-4">
        These cookies are essential for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are usually only set in response to actions you take, such as setting your privacy preferences or filling in forms.
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-base">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b rule">
              <th class="py-3 pr-6 font-medium text-ink">Cookie</th>
              <th class="py-3 pr-6 font-medium text-ink">Purpose</th>
              <th class="py-3 font-medium text-ink">Duration</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b rule">
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-ink">cookie-consent</td>
              <td class="py-3 pr-6 text-graphite">Stores your cookie consent preferences</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-graphite">1 year</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Analytics cookies</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-4">
        With your consent, we use privacy-first analytics (Plausible or Fathom) that do not use cookies to track you across sites and do not collect personal data. These are only loaded if you accept cookies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">Managing your preferences</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-4">
        You can change your cookie preferences at any time by clearing your browser's cookies for this site. This will reset the consent banner and allow you to choose again.
      </p>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite mb-8">
        Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can also delete cookies already stored on your device. See your browser's help section for guidance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display text-2xl text-ink mb-4">More information</h2>
      <p class="prose-body text-graphite">
        For more information about how we handle your data, please see our <a href="/privacy" class="text-ink underline">Privacy Policy</a>. If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:meadow.mace@harrowandthread.com" class="text-ink underline">meadow.mace@harrowandthread.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>